			"notes": "This update introduces a major redesign of the CrashPatch GUI. Instead of the (frankly) horrible and old VanillaFix GUI, we now have a OneConfig-inspired GUI.\n\n![bebf3533e064a85045f47b1d233b821d3b26f810](https://github.com/Polyfrost/CrashPatch/assets/45589059/f3d7a33d-9ac1-4448-b554-6f42f068564e)\n\n- **Add OneConfig**\nOneConfig is a free and open-source configuration library, designed to give developers a simple config API, which users can interact with in an elegant user interface. You can now simply click `R-SHIFT` on your keyboard to access any mod that uses OneConfig or supports it (any Vigilance mod, NEU, etc).\nTo find out more, join https://discord.gg/polyfrost.\n\n- Remove OneCore / Essential\n- Rewrite GUI\n- Fix CrashPatch not actually patching... crashes\n- Add ability to customize CrashPatch settings via OneConfig"
		},
